 "description": "<p>A one-piece bunny set in polyester: jumpsuit and headband in white, with S and M as real sizes. S runs bust 76-110 cm and waist 60-78 cm for 40-50 kg; M runs bust 85-120 and waist 75-90 for 50-60 kg.</p>\n<p>The measurements are printed per size, which puts this listing a step above the one-size bunny majority. White is the softer colorway against the category's black default.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: jumpsuit, headband</li>\n<li>Style: bunny girl one-piece</li>\n<li>Color: white</li>\n<li>Sizing: S (40-50 kg), M (50-60 kg) with per-size measurements</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by the printed chart. The two-size white option for buyers who checked the numbers first.</p>\n",
